WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.435
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:03.936
This is "Late Night." We hope
you're doing well tonight.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:05.705
Now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.706
Politico published an article
yesterday titled

00:00:07.706 --> 00:00:10.376
"Biden Won't Directly Address
the Age Issue."

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.245
Well, that's part
of the age issue.

00:00:12.245 --> 00:00:16.549
Guys that age don't directly
address anything.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:18.384
If you ask your grandpa
what time it is,

00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:20.386
he'll say something like,
"Come on out back with me, kid.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:22.055
We're gonna make a sundial."

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.890
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:26.259
President Biden met today
with a group of CEOs

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:27.593
to discuss the economy.

00:00:27.593 --> 00:00:30.830
"Look, we're all strapped
for cash," they said,

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.665
from space.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.801
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.803
After federal prosecutions filed
additional counts --

00:00:37.803 --> 00:00:40.406
federal prosecutors filed
additional counts against him,

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:42.542
George Santos told reporters
yesterday, quote,

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.711
"I'm pretty much denying
every last bit of charges."

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:47.547
"Pretty much"?

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:48.781
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.781 --> 00:00:52.285
What kind of defense
is "pretty much"?

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.454
"The defendant's been charged
with armed robbery

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:56.522
and two counts of murder one.
How do you plead?"

00:00:56.522 --> 00:01:00.360
"Like 95% not guilty,
Your Honor."

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:01.760
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.265
"Like, rounding up,
totally not guilty."

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.434
During a gathering this week

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.269
of Republican donors
and influencers,

00:01:10.269 --> 00:01:12.204
Utah Senator Mitt Romney
said, quote,

00:01:12.204 --> 00:01:15.041
"Our party has
multiple personality disorder."

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:17.076
Though Romney's trying
to offset that

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.212
by not having one at all.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:20.880
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.484
Russian President Vladimir Putin
traveled today to Kyrgyzstan

00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:26.352
on his first
foreign visit of the year,

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:29.355
where the leadership
begged Putin to send over

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:31.691
some much needed vowels.

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.727
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:40.166
[ Laughs ]
That's how dialed we are in

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.302
to the geopolitical situations
that are happening.

00:01:43.302 --> 00:01:44.904
You know what?
The good news is,

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.573
if Putin watched,

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:49.075
I think
he kind of liked that joke.

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.243
You know, I bet when Putin
watches the late night shows

00:01:51.243 --> 00:01:52.745
right now
and he sees his picture come up,

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:54.581
he's like,
[Russian accent] "Here we go."

00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:56.249
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.249 --> 00:02:00.018
"Okay, let me guess. They're
gonna dump on old Vlad again."

00:02:00.018 --> 00:02:01.354
[Normal voice] I bet he watched
that one, he was like...

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:03.189
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.291
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:09.395
[Russian accent]
I just had a good laugh.

00:02:09.395 --> 00:02:11.564
Don't push Ivan out the window.

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.600
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:16.736
[Normal voice]
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.604
hosted an event
at the White House yesterday

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:20.372
honoring teenage girls
and young women.

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:21.708
Smart move to plan it

00:02:21.708 --> 00:02:24.477
while Matt Gaetz is busy
with the speaker vote.

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:27.379
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:27.379 --> 00:02:30.383
[Russian accent] Well, I don't
like that. Matt is good friend.

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:33.219
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:35.555
It's about Ivan.
Yes, I've changed my mind.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:38.224
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:39.826
[Normal voice]
A teenager in Australia

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:41.326
recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:02:41.326 --> 00:02:42.929
after he solved
a Rubik's Cube

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.431
in under 12 seconds
while blindfolded.

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:48.100
Wow! How did he have
such nimble hands?

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.602
Ohh, okay.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:52.105
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:02:55.108 --> 00:02:56.942
[ Laughter ]

00:02:56.942 --> 00:03:00.480
There's a lot of reasons
that joke doesn't work.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.815
That's why --
That's why I like it.

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:04.316
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.316 --> 00:03:05.818
In a new interview,

00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:08.821
actress Jada Pinkett Smith said
that she and actor Will Smith

00:03:08.821 --> 00:03:11.323
have been separated since 2016.

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:14.327
And when he heard that,
Chris Rock slapped himself.

00:03:14.327 --> 00:03:16.930
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.865 --> 00:03:21.534
And finally, according
to a new study,

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:24.337
female frogs may pretend
they are dead

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:25.939
to avoid mating with male frogs.

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:27.373
Boy, you know the sex is bad

00:03:27.373 --> 00:03:29.876
when you'd rather be dissected
by eighth graders.

00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:31.043
[ Laughter ]

00:03:31.043 --> 00:03:32.645
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:35.915
We are off and running,
as they say.

